":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/bfe462604c63811cb542e7c0fc46185e/doc-icon-generated%402x.png","line":171,"embedded":true},{"title":"Image of an Xcode project document icon.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8cd56a7291cd6b41fe391958f704c823/doc-icon-custom-1%402x.png","line":175,"embedded":true},{"title":"Image of a document icon for an AR object.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a1449177968f693c1bd68c2b146df7c3/doc-icon-custom-2%402x.png","line":177,"embedded":true},{"title":"Image of a document icon for a Swift file.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/495bd043bf65349ec96f6728941386f8/doc-icon-custom-3%402x.png","line":179,"embedded":true},{"title":"A square canvas that contains a grid of pink lines and a jagged white EKG line that runs horizontally across the middle. The pink grid gets lighter in color toward the bottom edge.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2aed446834a2dc6e8275b6bd7a797ca9/doc-icon-parts-background-fill%402x.png","line":183,"embedded":true},{"title":"A solid pink heart.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b59c836903d1b409ab9e21f81762df3e/doc-icon-parts-center-image%402x.png","line":185,"embedded":true},{"title":"The word heart in all caps.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/56c5adedc0c08a167a4a03e706924ee6/doc-icon-parts-text%402x.png","line":187,"embedded":true},{"title":"A custom document icon that displays the pink heart and the word heart on top of the pink grid and white EKG line.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d5da9148d27f60891780ab1a9546a111/doc-icon-parts%402x.png","line":189,"embedded":true},{"title":"Apple Design Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/#macos-apps","line":191},{"title":"Image of an Xcode project document icon.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8cd56a7291cd6b41fe391958f704c823/doc-icon-custom-1%402x.png","line":197,"embedded":true},{"title":"Image of a TextEdit rich text document icon.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f32709a5ff5742e79fd03a58ae1dd9c6/doc-icon-fill-only%402x.png","line":199,"embedded":true},{"title":"Pixelated image of the heart document icon. The grid, the EKG line, the heart shape, and the word heart are visible but blurry.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/1f8bc7946a75363224f373924b557a3a/doc-icon-fewer-details-1%402x.png","line":203,"embedded":true},{"title":"Pixelated image of the heart document icon, in which only the blurry heart shape and EKG line are visible.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e46ac887801d9a16393948c3f2098715/doc-icon-fewer-details-2%402x.png","line":205,"embedded":true},{"title":"Pixelated image of the heart document icon, in which only the blurry heart shape is visible.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/fd0d2afcd76a9b25c1217ef2ffb1ad0e/doc-icon-fewer-details-3%402x.png","line":207,"embedded":true},{"title":"Diagram of the solid pink heart shape within blue margins that measure 10 percent of the canvas width.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7cc19b2ae1e99d26ba69e1351683ede1/doc-icon-parts-margins%402x.png","line":239,"embedded":true},{"title":"Image of a SceneKit scene document icon.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/3b4bb7de9edb5870d3a162aae8153163/doc-icon-custom-extension%402x.png","line":243,"embedded":true},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/icons#Resources","line":245},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/icons#Related","line":247},{"title":"App icons","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-icons","line":249},{"title":"SF Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/d